1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,968
Tilt the plane a little: an ellipse.

2
00:00:02,968 --> 00:00:09,830
Tilt it until it runs parallel to the side of the cone: the ellipse breaks open into a parabola.

3
00:00:09,830 --> 00:00:16,393
Tilt it further, so it cuts both halves of the cone: a hyperbola, in two branches.

